ければと思います。\n🌟✨🌟✨🌟✨🌟✨🌟✨🌟✨🌟✨\n\n以上となります。\n何かと忙しいかと思われますが、ご一考いただければと願っております。\n\nMelmi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@miriru_sham/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e9a4b0b61827373566363b113c75eef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e9a4b0b61827373566363b113c75eef, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8cf8adaf6f7dd5a69d2487cd497d590c 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3fe2754911717d8630b97153ed4639b 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは。\nいつも楽しい配信ありがとうございます。\nボイス依頼なのですが、最近寝付きが悪くとても困っています。\nなので睡眠前に聴くと心地良く寝られるようなとても可愛らしいボイスを頂けないでしょうか？\n宜しくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@miriru_sham/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e9a4b0b61827373566363b113c75eef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e9a4b0b61827373566363b113c75eef, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1946639576191156224%2Fc3H6-zoX.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8cf8ad